{TOOL} — record contract (the verb set IS the role boundary)
verbs: register, revision, manifest-row, dispute, confidence, position, closing, friction, petition, render, help
  register: FIRST ACTION at the seat: register --run <runDir> --seat-id <SEAT_ID from your prompt>
  revision: the round-record event (the CHANGELOG entry body via --file) — singleton per seat-round; emit AFTER your report edits land
  manifest-row: one correctness-manifest receipt per repaired gap: --id R2-3 --row "figures recomputed; acceptance check run: pass; sites swept: S2,S4"
  dispute: contest a grade through the accounted channel: --id <gap> --dimension severity|likelihood|impact|complexity_cost --proposed <grade> --evidence "..."
  confidence: per-claim confidence (the calibration substrate): --label <claim-label> --grade high|medium|low
  position: the round's ### BLUE section (prose via --file)
  closing: a ### BLUE CLOSING entry per docketed gap: --id <gap> --file <prose>
  friction: attributed friction (survives aborts as an event): --text|--file
  petition: petition the bench (never sanctioned; does not pause your duties): --class ethical|safety|integrity|constitutional --basis "..." --relief "..."
  render: read-only projection refresh (any seat may invoke)

